  "description": "I'm learning to love myself. \n\nHyeon-Jung, a physiotherapist, dreams of drawing comics despite her family constantly putting her down. Her boyfriend Seul-Gi is a successful cartoonist, but he can't stand it when he finds himself in a rut while Hyeon-Jung matures and evolves. The two find themselves on the way to splitting up... \n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
